    "description": "Join the V-Mart Retail South Asia Partners family as a Floor Manager in Vijayawada. We believe in empowering our employees with the tools, training, and environment they need to succeed.\n\nAbout V-Mart Retail South Asia Partners:\nV-Mart Retail South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct regular stock audits and prevent pilferage\n• Train and motivate the sales team to deliver excellent service\n• Monitor inventory levels and coordinate replenishment activities\n• Ensure visual merchandising standards are maintained at all times\n• Coordinate with the supply chain team for timely stock delivery\n• Build relationships with regular customers to drive loyalty\n• Prepare daily sales reports and share insights with management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in KPI Management\n• Proficiency in SAP Retail\n• Proficiency in CRM\n• Proficiency in Category Management\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n• Proficiency in Retail Operations\n• Proficiency in Omnichannel Retail\n• Proficiency in Team Leadership\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Referral bonus program\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with V-Mart Retail South Asia Partners!",
